[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0010","text":"──……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0020","text":"辛苦了，雏菜\n这有水，要喝吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0030","text":"呀哈～，那我就不客气啦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0035","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0040","text":"…………\n……啊哈～，好好喝～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0050","text":"雏菜的舞蹈，真的很棒……！\n我都看入迷了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0060","text":"啊哈～被夸了～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0070","text":"而且，雏菜乐在其中的那种感觉\n真的很好地传达过来了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0080","text":"……啊哈～\n对吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0090","text":"开心又幸福～才是最重要的嘛！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0100","text":"……嗯，说得对\n舞台，我很期待"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300200_02_0105","text":"Motion"}]
